# ---- written by the OWNER when they register the native host ----------------
# `install/register-host.mjs` generates these on the machine it is run on: they
# name that machine's node binary, that machine's Zeno workspace and that
# browser's extension id. Machine-specific configuration, never source — and
# `host-config.json` in particular points at a workspace holding a signing key.
host-config.json
com.zeno.chrome_bridge.json
zeno-chrome-host.bat
zeno-chrome-host.sh
